<p>Mr. Hoyeck <a href="https://x.com/PAHoyeck/status/2092644183332851832" target="_blank" rel="noopener">says</a> the lesson here is that &#8220;philosophers have done a pretty woeful job of marketing ourselves as the people who can teach and employ&#8230; crucial [critical thinking] skills&#8221;.</p>
